Lender is now able to do selfLiquidate his creditPosition for the corresponding debtPosition of the borrower B.

But lender can take a caluclated risk by only selfLiquidating a part of his credit by buying the equivalent credit of his own creditPosition using BuyCreditMarketOrder, as a result creditPosition is divided into two.
